  "content": "<h1>資本，現在自動化了！</h1><p><em><strong>由無名模組合作團隊為您呈現</strong></em></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcreate-trading-floor%252fguide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/cakeGit/Create-Trading-Floor/blob/1.20.1/shelf/tradingfloor_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage 橫幅\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7DvmP0f2wXE&amp;ab_channel=SomeGuyCalledCak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">觀看實際運作！</a></h2><p>簡單明瞭，<strong>新增了交易站方塊</strong>，可在 Create 模組中用於全天自動與村民交易。此方塊包含完整功能，支援護目鏡、顯示連結、輸送帶、滑槽及過濾器</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4635c03eeffbe7da1c221f98494c34db2a3039e6.png\" alt=\"村民使用交易站進行交易\"></p>",
